      "source": "Open navigation",
      "sourceSha256": "0ed77fd2619ba8ab3e1cce72c8e61d887d551ca1220164b88ab1aa66bba7177d"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0004",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#site-links/li[1]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The apps",
      "sourceSha256": "933c939832e7d7367d9cfd269a0b8be51ba4151253930400513116a6c8fbdd50"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0005",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#site-links/li[2]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Our principles",
      "sourceSha256": "0f2dbf9b9b161dc638beab2642bf6faa8ffca4e6cc518d3de76d4f9b89e73f88"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0006",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The Inner family",
      "sourceSha256": "7c9cfd0da7aa64df7e07f36e98df63ac91de00e540e2b1b7bcb6cc53cbd95736"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0007",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#hero-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "Apps for the space within.",
      "sourceSha256": "718479a3b76ae1d2433a115496c49c10d523d2a08264d6d0e2b460deea8e9685"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0008",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Five different doors. One intention: make room for something true.",
      "sourceSha256": "50fe82f608aceb40e3170bca513d0596a791fed6bb735eba447e77969809c1bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0009",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/div[1]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Meet the apps",
      "sourceSha256": "cdc6feded15088f5dda45284a8cc2d934ce1cbbab0f691690aaf52844e542ef2"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0010",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/div[1]/a[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Read on Moving Truth",
      "sourceSha256": "c90483b3ee7e1e2f3e6d61cb66f3229741634fef4f8543e868f083c1c95bf0e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0011",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "scroll to enter",
      "sourceSha256": "ac36d0bf73022fe7fee399b04bd459f4dd9c32d0e00bc09a546842595973529e"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0012",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#family-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "Made quietly. Made carefully. Made for real life.",
      "sourceSha256": "a35294dceab7479c7c6257ba832bb692d0133ff70a66346333f6c9719d0287ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0013",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[2]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Moving Truth apps are not feeds competing for attention. Each one makes a different kind of interior space: for a word, a thought, a reading, a question worth staying with, or somewhere for the hand to go.",
      "sourceSha256": "e22f2c58d3140f427ea7f63d493d1f6ccdb323f51aad8b9c8ed0260ff6b6db3b"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0014",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[2]/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "No single app asks to be everything. Together, they begin to form a place.",
      "sourceSha256": "c65e1dc71b7b7f11d69eb0c1c2affe290b06814d420e26e6622e472338089716"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0015",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[1]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Choose a doorway",
      "sourceSha256": "bc54d5f2f7b39a2afd29ce6526531173c27ec4ef8b7d3b255d038f7afed1a343"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0016",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "What do you need room for?",
      "sourceSha256": "16e3a3c84673c67f55f9b6ff6d9e462137f145f5af33a811042d2ea3bf7a0cda"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0017",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[1]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Begin with the app that meets the moment you are already in.",
      "sourceSha256": "74fe1fecd82d501125d65a2b62fe070baa256e30438ed72f8cab588d5957f36a"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0018",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[1]/div[1]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Available now",
      "sourceSha256": "2a4729fa7647b090374ca25dd057f5e604682b9ff1867b029c5afe3479183fcd"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0019",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[1]/div[1]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "A quiet space for words that find you.",
      "sourceSha256": "dd4e6aef8ed99aaaf40960a07c5f276ebc05cf16cd27528c8f812150b7c074b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0020",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[1]/div[1]/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "One quote, placed quietly into the rhythm of your day. Not a feed. Not a list. A whisper.",
      "sourceSha256": "6e7bf30f85d888313c39b6312f96aa42e1bb797deb688b3384850d4fc6fa933f"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0021",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[1]/div[1]/span[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Enter Inner Whisper →",
      "sourceSha256": "d136d49dd37e60c83b3db1849f90ff19922abb5ff261373631d65a5e3b0c97ec"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0022",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[2]/div[1]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Available now",
      "sourceSha256": "2a4729fa7647b090374ca25dd057f5e604682b9ff1867b029c5afe3479183fcd"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0023",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[2]/div[1]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "One gesture. Say what’s inside. Keep it safely.",
      "sourceSha256": "41d1d45dce382ab16e909b47fe43c4430f56bd48dce3dfdf961e87444cadef53"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0024",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[2]/div[1]/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Catch what would otherwise vanish—spoken, written, photographed, or filmed—without making organization part of capture.",
      "sourceSha256": "a4f2a9947bc672242aa32744549ff2931eb2a6904c79a929c09cc4a3ad548889"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0025",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[2]/div[1]/span[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Enter Inner Thought →",
      "sourceSha256": "2dff5dd391d9f4785b7f629ad8fdd90d331d78bab31637823141541124a0931c"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0026",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[3]/div[1]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Coming soon",
      "sourceSha256": "4f7d64017689437e6d93f5724f3f797054f3935d98a13148025b616b8db8fb2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0027",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[3]/div[1]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Sun, number, zodiac, and moon—one reading, drawn fresh each day.",
      "sourceSha256": "c996fa5c0143784369ac77d71b22385297854b16a451351b0e84b5fa59fa0cd5"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0028",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[3]/div[1]/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Four independent traditions meet in one transparent daily reading, with three honest ways to read the sky.",
      "sourceSha256": "05423e7cf4fdabea3140d1ebc86c64ca3d8d812ec68343144e2f8eab027a5ceb"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0029",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[3]/div[1]/span[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Enter Inner Sign →",
      "sourceSha256": "294859aa00c89b96ec7799b9d4cfae5171551df7de40adad7a08cc9018e14219"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0030",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[4]/div[1]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Coming soon",
      "sourceSha256": "4f7d64017689437e6d93f5724f3f797054f3935d98a13148025b616b8db8fb2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0031",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[4]/div[1]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Where Moving Truth moves outward, Inner Course moves in.",
      "sourceSha256": "906b8ec1efda5796a7a50b1e81913790a0c09607855b2e15acc5f333af935f58"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0032",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[4]/div[1]/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Lessons and reflection, not a feed and not a quote collection. A companion for questions worth living with.",
      "sourceSha256": "17f9f6fbf780c9f62c7b38c52d0de844345fee294f2c85ed575bc20961ec2c24"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0033",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[4]/div[1]/span[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Enter Inner Course →",
      "sourceSha256": "dcd2d7a65851cbbb61308ea91f0b09a3814c90cea972cd032999aacfb4e1d73a"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0034",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[5]/div[1]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Coming soon · provisional icon",
      "sourceSha256": "308ee72fa48a529ba983023b4228a1953b5278d85fdccce1ad82e14c523da7c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0035",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[5]/div[1]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Something for your hands. Space for your mind.",
      "sourceSha256": "1e63725203af3e1af776567c24098ee517d7538df15927dccd0803a26894bf3e"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0036",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[5]/div[1]/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "A quiet cabinet of tactile digital objects—spinners, switches, sliders, and controls that respond with believable motion, sound, and haptics.",
      "sourceSha256": "9d65c2d3f6411f6362cc0d2bbf642fb9c716bd2d5bdbaae4a25961d079205d71"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0037",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#apps/div[2]/a[5]/div[1]/span[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Enter Inner Play →",
      "sourceSha256": "7baa7ee1aa40ff9ebe93d7647be8b5f13a145b63c1aae0de7403c98512413674"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0038",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#principles/span[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The foundation beneath every app",
      "sourceSha256": "689819e55c2042ac3875159bea199f3b73d197007cd56f7d813987f7e65ae019"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0039",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#principles-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "Human first. Private by design. Accessible from the beginning.",
      "sourceSha256": "83c81cf63bbcb9e0ad34e090652402551b0a432804abce72341a3896cba710f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0040",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#principles/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Every Moving Truth app begins with the same permanent foundation: human dignity, ethical restraint, understandable privacy, and technology that serves the person holding it. Beauty must make function feel natural—not obscure it.",
      "sourceSha256": "72766be6dd3bdecc6f5f4a20cf3d02aa03d885beeab9166ec3958e6bdbcb006f"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0041",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#principles/ul[1]/li[1]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Accessibility is a release requirement.",
      "sourceSha256": "6c4c855a8a0b00f2ecf5a6544126481d4d141c3d116cd578fdc121be7ea4db9a"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0042",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#principles/ul[1]/li[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Every Apple-platform app is designed and tested against Apple’s applicable accessibility guidance throughout its life—not treated as a separate edition or a final polish pass.",
      "sourceSha256": "f92b94c5486c7f7dea125e542f287cd683bd528cc951db256deb4b3fcecc7489"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0043",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#principles/ul[1]/li[2]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Fourteen languages, everywhere.",
      "sourceSha256": "552bc02c76d02d728c59ab5f137ad24211337e3230d0f0cb6e0d4f16af2f08fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0044",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#principles/ul[1]/li[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Every current and future Moving Truth app begins with the same fourteen-language architecture so people across the world receive the whole experience, not a translated fragment.",
      "sourceSha256": "a3e3a1fa80a3962f52862d1c8b6a2df75f5851754066c2156b44aecf1c05d915"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0045",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#principles/ul[1]/li[3]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Privacy and ethics are structural.",
      "sourceSha256": "40996c473f1200fa35b1236fd4cfe69f0d5e62dd5439cdce14efd994db7eeb36"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0046",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#principles/ul[1]/li[3]/text()[1]",
      "source": "No person’s inner life should become the product. Data collection, permissions, business models, notifications, and new technology must remain honest, proportionate, and under human control.",
      "sourceSha256": "8f5cd33b9cdea13d227d002d6beb60b72ba4a975b2536772c35e77de63a85ab4"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0047",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#principles/ul[1]/li[4]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "iOS is the reference expression.",
      "sourceSha256": "6c0ef59b9e77bd4770daa48a03774d0b5d30067528f4e0cbb67a3d9a499b738b"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0048",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#principles/ul[1]/li[4]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Some apps will also have a native Android counterpart with the same human, privacy, accessibility, ethical, and language commitments. It will be built honestly for Android rather than presented as an identical visual copy: some of the depth, material, motion, and system integration possible on Apple platforms cannot be reproduced there in exactly the same way.",
      "sourceSha256": "9dab1ad64c7c4c91b436e729cd7cff6b7aad3794dbdfe82f932f9aaff868f698"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0049",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[5]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "by Moving Truth",
      "sourceSha256": "3daa3456fa0b55162e7c72b8d69a3fff181d034edf3423bcf3ce5a972cf2aab4"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0050",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[5]/small[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Made with love by Skylaur Roe",
      "sourceSha256": "8973d1d4a4d34a688cb6e6d9080ec19b076e65b44fac74776e850e1cfb0f6562"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0051",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[6]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The work is growing",
      "sourceSha256": "2c0bb8a06aa526fe56ad273dabe59b39a52ca3bb3c6c77677a6eb0f7cdbbdbd4"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0052",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#closing-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "Take the door that opens.",
      "sourceSha256": "886a1a855e79c0ec38f102c4814d408123aec5693ac47fbd12d82e962839c7a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0053",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[6]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Some of these apps are here now. Others are still becoming. Each will arrive as one complete, careful offering when it is ready.",
      "sourceSha256": "8ba735699195468fc22b8f3dd3f95ca6b8dcbb6cda0cfbfad8054cf77476e3a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0054",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[6]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Ask about the apps",
      "sourceSha256": "e89be4425dad556271ef0b82081f658a7cec67e4336480c7b2b54168b6d08d9f"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0055",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/html[1]/body[1]/footer[1]/nav[1]/ul[1]/li[1]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The apps",
      "sourceSha256": "933c939832e7d7367d9cfd269a0b8be51ba4151253930400513116a6c8fbdd50"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0056",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/html[1]/body[1]/footer[1]/nav[1]/ul[1]/li[2]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Principles",
      "sourceSha256": "0be561015c991b10fdfaaadf526aac7c6559f62e347df73a1abbb74ec058010e"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0057",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/html[1]/body[1]/footer[1]/nav[1]/ul[1]/li[3]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Support",
      "sourceSha256": "be91940b79f469101df9a50544b6873aa5509a12f1f93f1cb5e3be3990d344b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.text.0058",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/html[1]/body[1]/footer[1]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "© 2026 Moving Truth. The work speaks.",
      "sourceSha256": "d42377d4adb1a2882e1d5ae39e18613c9f6241f852c4a4b2a38a8728b34c8d61"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps.index.attribute.0001",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "attribute",
      "locator": "/html[1]/head[1]/meta[4]/@content",
